module mistake_noeffect .
rem expect: E-FFI-NOEFFECT

rem ko: ✘ 효과 줄이 없다 --- 부르는 쪽이 무엇을 떠안는지 머리에서 알 수 없다 /// en: ✘ no effects line --- callers cannot learn from the head what they take on
unsafe extern proc c_area do
  input k cap c .
  input w i64 .
  input h i64 .
  output i64 .
  link "lw_c_area" .
end
